James received an invitation from Helen on behalf of the *Explorations in Humanities and Social Sciences* (EHSS) editorial board to serve as Editor-in-Chief/Associate Editor. The email highlighted his contributions to global economic systems and the responsibilities associated with the role, including ensuring quality, setting strategy, upholding ethics, and promoting the journal. James, after consideration, decided to decline the invitation. He drafted a professional response expressing gratitude for the offer while stating that he is currently committed to ongoing projects and cannot take on new obligations. The email concluded with well wishes for the journal's success.
